    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Gloamryn!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mystical strategy game set in a world of eternal twilight, where survival is as much about cunning as it is about strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this land of fading light, resources are scarce, enemies lurk in the shadows, and magic pulses through the earth itself.<br>Build camps, gather supplies, and master the art of tactical combat as you lead your people through the unknown.<br>Will you seek refuge under the glowing leaves of the Healing Tree, strike dangerous bargains with witches, or carve your own path in the twilight?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices are yours \u2013 welcome to Gloamryn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Combat - A Unique Card Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544040/extras/804851cebc8f7ccf366b24415310a2ce.avif?t=1747608549\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical combat in Gloamryn takes place through a unique, specifically designed card game. Your units, their equipment, and their abilities shape every battle, while each faction brings its own way of fighting. No two encounters play out the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544040/extras/9e2fb70f689732eba7a93d7e34eb3f81.avif?t=1747608549\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large strategic map to explore. A procedurally generated world for great replayability. Turn-based movement with countless encounters and places to visit, offering endless possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544040/extras/eb288dea8314c1fee234d3262af359f9.avif?t=1747608549\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival and Growth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544040/extras/6daa6f9694ab63416025b8a8ad1227e4.avif?t=1747608549\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, craft equipment and perform magic rituals. Set up camps or establish a settlement. Accumulate wealth and improve your chances of survival in this dark world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544040/extras/1c726f9a002f1f25aec77efcdfa69ff2.avif?t=1747608549\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade and Economy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544040/extras/4e86e3a4e3fce18acb7e30f1d9d645fa.avif?t=1747608549\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People of Gloamryn would not survive without trade, and neither will you. Throughout the land, town markets, wandering merchants, and trade posts offer trade opportunities - you just have to find them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544040/extras/67e680b92ca07196a5447d5692eacd35.avif?t=1747608549\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the main campaign, take on side quests, or carve your own path in free play. A great adventure awaits in Gloamryn, the world of eternal twilight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Gloamryn!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mystical strategy game set in a world of eternal twilight, where survival is as much about cunning as it is about strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this land of fading light, resources are scarce, enemies lurk in the shadows, and magic pulses through the earth itself.<br>Build camps, gather supplies, and master the art of tactical combat as you lead your people through the unknown.<br>Will you seek refuge under the glowing leaves of the Healing Tree, strike dangerous bargains with witches, or carve your own path in the twilight?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices are yours \u2013 welcome to Gloamryn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Combat - A Unique Card Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544040/extras/804851cebc8f7ccf366b24415310a2ce.avif?t=1747608549\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical combat in Gloamryn takes place through a unique, specifically designed card game. Your units, their equipment, and their abilities shape every battle, while each faction brings its own way of fighting. No two encounters play out the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544040/extras/9e2fb70f689732eba7a93d7e34eb3f81.avif?t=1747608549\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large strategic map to explore. A procedurally generated world for great replayability. Turn-based movement with countless encounters and places to visit, offering endless possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544040/extras/eb288dea8314c1fee234d3262af359f9.avif?t=1747608549\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival and Growth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544040/extras/6daa6f9694ab63416025b8a8ad1227e4.avif?t=1747608549\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, craft equipment and perform magic rituals. Set up camps or establish a settlement. Accumulate wealth and improve your chances of survival in this dark world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544040/extras/1c726f9a002f1f25aec77efcdfa69ff2.avif?t=1747608549\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade and Economy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544040/extras/4e86e3a4e3fce18acb7e30f1d9d645fa.avif?t=1747608549\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People of Gloamryn would not survive without trade, and neither will you. Throughout the land, town markets, wandering merchants, and trade posts offer trade opportunities - you just have to find them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544040/extras/67e680b92ca07196a5447d5692eacd35.avif?t=1747608549\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the main campaign, take on side quests, or carve your own path in free play. A great adventure awaits in Gloamryn, the world of eternal twilight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
